 "name_en": "Scrapping in Warehouse (1G0)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Scrapping in Warehouse (1G0)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio217264aae17649a0be2695f2447ff510\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio217264aae17649a0be2695f2447ff510__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">In this scope item, you can decide to scrap goods that are currently stored in any of the storage types in the warehouse. The scrapping process can be initiated based on the expired shelf life of a stock item, or it can be triggered by discovering damaged goods in the warehouse in daily work.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">For the first approach, you can search for expired stock items in the Warehouse Monitor. You then initiate the scrapping by creating the needed warehouse orders and tasks. The system supports scrapping for all storage types. Depending on the physical layout of the warehouse, the system automatically creates the warehouse orders and tasks and assigns them to the corresponding RF queues. The actual scrapping, including the financially relevant postings, can be done manually or with a periodically scheduled program.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio217264aae17649a0be2695f2447ff510__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Initiate scrapping manually by discovering damaged goods or automatically based on the expired shelf life of a stock item</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Move items from their storage to the scrapping zone</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Empty scrapping zone and post goods issue</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio217264aae17649a0be2695f2447ff510__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage stock on a storage bin level</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Provides flexible variations of the scrapping process</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Supports all storage types of the preconfigured warehouse</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Enables RF/mobile processes</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>仓库中的报废 (1G0)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio217264aae17649a0be2695f2447ff510\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio217264aae17649a0be2695f2447ff510__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">在此范围项目中，您可以决定报废当前存储在仓库中的任何存储类型的货物。报废流程可以根据库存项目的过期货架寿命启动，也可以在日常工作中通过发现仓库中的受损货物来触发。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">对于第一种方法，您可以在仓库监控器中搜索过期的库存项目。然后通过创建所需的仓库订单和任务启动报废。系统支持所有存储类型的报废。根据仓库的实际布局，系统会自动创建仓库订单和任务，并将其分配到相应的 RF 队列。实际报废（包括财务相关过账）可以手动完成，也可以使用定期计划程序完成。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio217264aae17649a0be2695f2447ff510__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">通过发现受损货物手动启动报废，或基于库存项目的过期货架寿命自动启动报废</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将项目从其存储移动到报废区</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">清空报废区并过账发货</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio217264aae17649a0be2695f2447ff510__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在仓位级别管理库存</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提供灵活的报废流程变式</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">支持预配置仓库的所有存储类型</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">启用 RF/移动流程</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
